  "mismatches_and_boundaries": [
    "XLSX x14 owner admits all 11 controls, but VML mirror diagnostics are present for native Excel defaults/legacy mirrors. These diagnostics are expected observations, not package-open failures.",
    "Combo Box and List Box expose fmlaRange and linked cells but no x14 itemLst; the typed item list is therefore empty by design for this native source.",
    "The XLSB package has no ctrlProps parts or typed form-control owner. Its drawing/VML mirrors contain all 11 controls, while litchi-xlsb only exposes inert package/drawing data.",
    "The XLS Workbook stream contains all 11 native Obj records, but the typed litchi-xls FormControl view exposes only 8. DropDown object id 2 and List object id 3 hit the current truncated Obj subrecord boundary; Button object id 10 is intentionally excluded because ObjectType::Button is not in FormControl::is_form_control.",
    "The Scroll Bar x14 property omits min, so the XLSX typed projection reports authored min=None with effective minimum 0; BIFF8 FtSbs stores minimum=0.",
    "Native XLS Label 9 reopened as plain text wrapping to two lines, while the OOXML version remained bold/single-line; this is a native legacy presentation difference."
  ],
